  "fullDescription": "Bring summer vibes to any project with this Magical Tropical Fruit Clipart Bundle. This set includes 31 glossy, cartoon-style fruit illustrations with magical sparkles and stars — perfect for adding a playful, tropical touch.\n\nWhat you get:\n\n31 PNG files 300 DPI transparent backgrounds\nFruits included: Watermelon, grapes, strawberry, coconut, star cookie, blueberry, pear, peach, melon, lychee, fig, pineapple, cherry, orange, kiwi, mango\nStyle: Bold outlines, vibrant colors, glossy highlights, and whimsical sparkle effects. Mix of kawaii faces and realistic cartoon rendering\nPerfect for:\n\nDigital planners, stickers, and scrapbooking\nT-shirts, mugs, phone cases, tote bags for POD\nParty invitations, birthday decor, summer campaigns\nClassroom decor, worksheets, teacher resources\nJunk journals, card making, nursery art, social posts\nAll elements are high-resolution and scale beautifully for print or web. Previews show a blue gradient background, but files are delivered with transparent backgrounds for easy layering.",
